          "jcr:created": "Mon Jul 25 2022 18:46:47 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Program objectives</span></span><br>\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Identifying challenging anatomy</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Managing hardware</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Tips and tricks for difficult exposures</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">How to use technology in total hip surgery</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">How to address and resolve complications</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
